return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T07:04:52+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T07:04:52+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works.'=>'Akiba ya kurasa na akiba ya kitu cha aina ya Redis kwa tovuti yoyote ya WordPress. Hutumia akiba ya seva ya LiteSpeed pale inapopatikana na akiba yake ya diski mahali pengine pote, hufuta tu kile mabadiliko yanachoathiri, na huthibitisha kuwa muunganisho wake wa Redis unafanya kazi.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Akiba ya muda','Page cache'=>'Kache ya ukurasa','Object cache'=>'Akiba ya vitu','Purging'=>'Inafuta','Exclusions'=>'Vizuvi','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Mawakala wa AI (MCP)','Purge everything now'=>'Safisha kila kitu sasa','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'Kila ukurasa uliowekwa kwenye akiba unafutwa na utajengwa upya kadiri wageni wanavyowili. Unataka kuendelea?','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Ruhusu mawakala wa AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Imezimwa: zana zilizoorodheshwa hapa chini na njia zao za REST hazijasajiliwa kabisa.','Full-page cache'=>'Kache ya ukurasa mzima','On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'Kwenye seva ya LiteSpeed, kurasa hutolewa na seva ya mtandao kabla WordPress haijaanza kufanya kazi. Kwenye seva nyingine yoyote, programu jalizi hii huhifadhi kila ukurasa kama faili na kuutoa kabla WordPress haijapakia. Hapa ndipo kasi yote takriban inakotoka.','Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in'=>'Hifadhi kurasa kwenye kache kwa wageni ambao hawajaingia kwenye akaunti','How long a page stays cached'=>'Muda ambao ukurasa unakaa kwenye kache','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Sekunde. Wiki moja inafaa tovuti nyingi; tovuti ya habari inayochapisha kila saa inahitaji muda mfupi zaidi.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Muda ambao kivinjari cha mgeni huweka picha na hati tumizi','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Sekunde. Inahusu picha, CSS na JavaScript pekee — haihusu kurasa kamwe. Weka 0 ili kuiachia mwenyeji wako.','Signed-in visitors'=>'Wagenzi walioingia kwenye mfumo','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Kamwe usimhudumie mgeni aliyeingia kwenye akaunti yake ukurasa uliowekwa kwenye kache','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'On ndiyo jibu salama na chaguo-msingi. Izimie tu ikiwa unajua kwamba kila kurasa iliyohifadhiwa kwenye kashia ni sawa kwa kila mtumiaji aliyeingia — tovuti ya uanachama ndiyo sababu ya kawaida ya kutofanya hivyo.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Muda tofauti wa maisha kwa maudhui tofauti','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Kwa mfano: kurasa za bidhaa za duka kwa saa moja, wakati kila kitu kingine kinakaa wiki moja.','Add a rule'=>'Ongeza sheria','Content type'=>'Aina ya maudhui','Seconds'=>'Sekunde','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Akiba ya vitu (Redis)','Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working.'=>'Mwenyeji wako anaendesha akiba binafsi ya vitu vya Redis kwa tovuti hii na kuiweka ikiwa imesanidiwa. Hakuna cha kusanidi hapa; hali iliyo juu ya skrini hii inaonyesha ikiwa inafanya kazi.','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Huweka akiba matokeo ya hoja za hifadhidata. Inasaidia zaidi kwenye duka lenye shughuli nyingi au tovuti yenye trafiki kubwa ya walioingia kwenye akaunti, ambapo akiba ya kurasa haiwezi kusaidia.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Sakinisha kijenzi cha kache ya vitu cha Redis','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'Inahitaji kiendelezi cha phpredis. Ikiwa haipo, sanduku lililo juu ya skrini hii linaeleza hivyo.','Redis host'=>'Mwenyeji wa Redis','Redis port'=>'Mlango wa Redis','Redis database'=>'Hifadhidata ya Redis','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Mpe kila tovuti kwenye Redis inayoshirikiwa nambari yake yenyewe, la sivyo zitafuta kashi za kila moja.','Redis username'=>'Jina la mtumiaji la Redis','Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone.'=>'Ni kwa ajili ya seva ya Redis yenye watumiaji wa ACL (Redis 6 au toleo jipya zaidi). Acha wazi ili uingie ukitumia nenosiri pekee.','Redis password'=>'Nenosiri la Redis','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Acha wazi ikiwa Redis yako haihitaji moja.','Key prefix'=>'Kiambishi awali cha kitufe','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Njia mbadala ya nambari tofauti ya hifadhidata wakati huwezi kuwa nayo.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Usafishaji-otomatiki wa akili','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Futa kiotomatiki kurasa zilizoathiriwa wakati maudhui yanabadilika','After updates'=>'Baada ya sasisho','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Futa kila kitu baada ya sasisho la mfumo mkuu, programu-jalizi au mandhari','After a comment'=>'Baada ya maoni','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Futa ukurasa wa chapisho wakati maoni juu yake yameidhinishwa','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Zima hii kwenye sehemu ya maoni yenye shughuli nyingi, ambapo inaweza kufuta ukurasa huo huo mamia ya mara kwa saa.','Never cache these'=>'Usihifadhi kamwe kwenye akiba haya','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'Viwango maalum vya WordPress na WooCommerce vinatumika kila wakati—kikapu, malipo, akaunti yangu na kipindi chochote kilichoingia havihifadhiwa kwenye kache kamwe, chochote kilicho hapa chini.','Addresses'=>'Anwani','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Njia moja kwa kila mstari, kwa mfano <code>/basket</code>. <code>*</code> inayofuata mwishoni inalingana na kila kitu kilicho chini yake.','Query parameters'=>'Vigezo vya ulizo','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Ukurasa wenye mojawapo ya haya hauhifadhiwi kamwe kwenye kache — kwa mfano, ishara ya hakiki ya mara moja tu.','Cookies'=>'Vidakuzi','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Mgeni anayebeba moja ya hizi daima hutumiwa ukurasa mpya.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Kila ukurasa uliowekwa kwenye akiba umefutwa. Zitajengwa upya kadiri wageni wanavyofika.','The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything.'=>'Akiba ya vitu imesakinishwa, lakini haihifadhi chochote.','The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet.'=>'Kache ya ukurasa imewashwa, bado kurasa hazijahifadhiwa.','WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php.'=>'WordPress bado haijapakia kidondusha cha kache ya ukurasa. Huanza kwenye upakiaji wa ukurasa unaofuata; ikiwa haifanyi hivyo, angalia kwamba WP_CACHE ni ya kweli katika wp-config.php.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'Akiba ya vitu imewashwa, lakini seva hii haina usaidizi wa Redis.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Upanuzi wa phpredis haujasakinishwa, kwa hivyo programu jalizi ya kuangusha haitumiki na WordPress inarejelea akiba yake ya kumbukumbu ya ndani. Mwombe mwenyeji wako kuwezesha phpredis.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Hakuna kinachowekwa kwenye akiba.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Kache zote mbili zimezimwa, kwa hivyo programu jalizi hii haifanyi tovuti iwe ya kasi zaidi.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Uhifadhi wa akiba umewashwa kwenye tovuti hii.','Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen.'=>'Redis imekataa jina la mtumiaji au nenosiri. Angalia kitambulisho cha Redis katika wp-config.php au kwenye skrini hii.','Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site\'s key prefix.'=>'Redis imekubali kuingia lakini hairuhusu tovuti hii kuhifadhi funguo zake. Mtumiaji wa Redis anahitaji ruhusa kwa kiambishi awali cha ufunguo wa tovuti hii.','Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting.'=>'Redis imekataa nambari ya hifadhidata. Angalia mpangilio wa hifadhidata ya Redis.','Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data.'=>'Redis imeishiwa na kumbukumbu na inakataa data mpya.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Kiendelezi cha phpredis hakijasakinishwa, kwa hiyo WordPress inatumia kache yake ya ndani ya kumbukumbu. Mwombe mwenyeji wako wa wavuti awezeshe phpredis.','WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off.'=>'WP_REDIS_DISABLED imewekwa katika wp-config.php, kwa hiyo akiba ya kitu imezimwa.','The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running.'=>'Seva ya Redis haikuwezekana kufikiwa. Angalia mwenyeji na bandari ya Redis, na uhakikishe kuwa Redis inafanya kazi.','Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server\'s logs.'=>'Redis haijarudisha thamani ambayo imetoka tu kuandikwa ndani yake. Angalia kumbukumbu za seva ya Redis.','Web server'=>'Seva ya mtandao','LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server'=>'LiteSpeed — kurasa zinahifadhiwa kwenye kache na seva ya wavuti','not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin'=>'si LiteSpeed — kurasa zinahifadhiwa kwenye diski na programu-jalizi hii','Pages stored on disk'=>'Kurasa zilizohifadhiwa kwenye diski','Redis support'=>'Usaidizi wa Redis','phpredis is installed'=>'phpredis imewekwa','phpredis is not installed'=>'phpredis haijasakinishwa','Page lifetime'=>'Muda wa kuishi wa ukurasa','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kusafisha akiba.','Cache purge requested.'=>'Ombi la kusafisha akiba limewasilishwa.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: kache nyingine ya vitu imewekwa, kwa hivyo kache ya vitu ya Redis haisimamiwi na programu-jalizi hii.','detected'=>'kimegunduliwa','not detected'=>'hakijagunduliwa','phpredis extension missing'=>'kiendelezi cha phpredis hakipo','installed, not storing anything'=>'imesakinishwa, haihifadhi chochote','active, managed by your host'=>'inayotumika, inasimamiwa na mwenyeji wako','active'=>'amilifu','inactive'=>'haifanyi kazi','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Akiba ya LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Akiba ya vitu ya Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Kiendelezi cha PHP cha Redis (phpredis) hakipatikani kwenye seva hii, kwa hivyo akiba ya vitu haiwezi kuwezeshwa.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Kipengele kingine cha kushusha cha kache ya vitu kimesakinishwa tayari. Kiondoe kabla ya kuwezesha kache ya vitu ya Zinn®.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Haikuweza kuandika faili ya usanidi wa muunganisho wa Redis.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu kilichoambatanishwa hakikuweza kusomwa.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Haikuweza kusakinisha kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu ndani ya wp-content.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Haikuweza kuondoa kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Mfumo wa faili wa WordPress hauwezi kuandikwa, kwa hivyo kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu hakikuweza kusimamiwa.','Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache.'=>'Programu jalizi nyingine ya akiba ya kurasa imeweka wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Ondoa programu jalizi hiyo kwanza, au uendelee kutumia akiba yake ya kurasa.','The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'Folda ya wp-content/cache/zinn-cache haikuweza kuandikwa, kwa hivyo kurasa haziwezi kuwekwa kwenye kache.','wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'wp-content/advanced-cache.php haikuwezi kuandikwa, kwa hiyo kurasa haziwezi kuwekwa kwenye akiba.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Huduma ya usasishaji ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha upakuaji kwa sasisho hili. Hakikisha kuwa tovuti hii inaweza kufikia jukwaa la Zinn®, kisha jaribu tena.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya sasisho ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa lilishindwa ukaguzi wake wa uadilifu na halikusakinishwa.','Go Pro'=>'Nenda Pro','A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands.'=>'Skrini ya takwimu za kache: uwiano wa maonyesho, kumbukumbu, funguo na amri za kache za polepole zaidi.','A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible.'=>'Kifaa kinachotambua maswali ya polepole na miito isiyohifadhiwa kwenye akiba (uncached-calls) kinachotaja programu jalizi au mandhari husika.','An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer.'=>'Safu ya APCu iliyo kwenye kumbukumbu mbele ya Redis kwa ajili ya funguo zinazotumika zaidi, pamoja na ufyatuzi wa awali, finazo na kisimbaji cha igbinary.','Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together.'=>'Kusafisha kwa msingi wa lebo kwa machapisho, istilahi na bidhaa za WooCommerce, ili ni kile kilichobadilika tu ndicho kinachoondolewa, huku kache za kurasa na vitu zikisafishwa pamoja.','Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript.'=>'Kupasha moto kiotomatiki kache baada ya kusafisha, picha za WebP na AVIF, kuondolewa kwa CSS isiyotumika, na kucheleweshwa kwa JavaScript.','Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules.'=>'Usafishaji wa hifadhidata uliopangwa pamoja na hakikisho, na sheria za kache kwa kila ukurasa.','Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills.'=>'Arifa za afya ya kache katika dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital® uwiano wa kufanikiwa unaposhuka au kumbukumbu inapojaa.','Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:'=>'Kila kitu kwenye tabu zingine ni bure na kitaendelea kuwa bure. Pro inaingia juu ya plagi hii na kuongeza:','See what Pro costs'=>'Angalia gharama za Pro','Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites.'=>'Kila mpango unaanza na jaribio la siku 14 bila malipo, hakuna kadi inayohitajika: %1$s kwa mwaka kwa tovuti moja, %2$s kwa tovuti tano, %3$s kwa tovuti zisizo na kikomo.','wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'wp-config.php haijapatikana, kwa hivyo WP_CACHE haikuweza kuwashwa. Ongeza define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); kwenye faili hilo.','wp-config.php already defines WP_CACHE as false, so the page cache cannot start. Change it to true.'=>'wp-config.php tayari imefafanua WP_CACHE kuwa false, kwa hivyo akiba ya ukurasa haiwezi kuanza. Badilisha iwe true.','wp-config.php is not writable, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'wp-config.php haiwezi kuandikwa, kwa hiyo WP_CACHE haikuweza kuwashwa. Ongeza define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); humo.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Imetunza. Andika thamani mpya ili kuichukua nafasi.','Filter this list…'=>'Chuja orodha hii...','Filter this list'=>'Chuja orodha hii','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Hakuna kinacholingana na kichungi hicho.','Add a row'=>'Ongeza safu','Remove this row'=>'Ondoa safu hii','Remove'=>'Odoa','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — muhtasari','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Copied'=>'Imenakopwa','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kila programu jalizi ya Zinn® kwenye tovuti hii, na kama inafanya kazi.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Hakuna muunganisho unaohitajika kwa programu-jalizi hii.','Open settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kubadilisha mipangilio hii.','Settings sections'=>'Sehemu za mipangilio','Support'=>'Usaidizi','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Tools'=>'Zana','Export settings'=>'Hamisha mipangilio','Reset to defaults'=>'Rudisha kwa chaguo-msingi','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Hii inarejesha kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii katika hali yake ya awali. Uendelee?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Uchunguzi wa usaidizi','Import a settings file'=>'Ingiza faili la mipangilio','Import'=>'Ingiza','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faili zilizosafirishwa haziwezi kuwa na nywila, ishara au funguo za API — utahitaji kuingiza tena kwenye tovuti mpya.','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii umerudi kwenye hali yake chaguomsingi.','Done.'=>'Imekamilika.','That action is not available.'=>'Kitendo hicho hakipatikani.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa. Chochagua faili ya mipangilio iliyosafirishwa kutoka kwa programu jalizi ya Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo ni kubwa mno kuwa usafirishaji wa mipangilio.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faili hilo si usafirishaji wa mipangilio ya Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faili hiyo ilisafirishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi nyingine (%s), kwa hivyo kuileta hapa kutahifadhi mipangoni ambayo programu-jalizi hii haielewi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Mpangilio %d umeingizwa. Nywila na funguo za API haziwahi kuwepo kwenye usafirishaji, kwa hivyo ziingize tena.' . "\0" . 'Mipangilio %d imeletwa. Nywila na funguo za API hazipo kwenye usafirishaji kamwe, kwa hivyo weka hizo tena.','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Connecting…'=>'Inaunganisha…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini kuna jambo linahitaji uangalifu','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Running on your own account'=>'Inayoendeshwa kwenye akaunti yako mwenyewe','We could not check this'=>'Hatukuweza kuangalia hili','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Plugin hii haikusema sababu. Tuma ripoti ya uchunguzi na tutaiangalia.','Connection status'=>'Hali ya muunganisho','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Iliwekwa mwisho kuangaliwa %s zilizopita.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(inafungua kwenye kichupo kipya)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Hiki ndicho kitakachotumwa hasa — hakuna kingine, wala chochote kilichofichwa. Nywila zako, tokeni na funguo za API hazimo ndani yake.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ripoti ya uchunguzi itakayotumwa','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nakili kwenye ubao klipu','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma ripoti hii kwa msaada wa Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Tunakufungulia tiketi ya usaidizi na kukujibu kupitia barua pepe. Ikiwa unapendelea kutoituma, ikili nakala hapo juu na ubandike kwenye tiketi wewe mwenyewe.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Hatukuweza kufika Zinn Digital® kutoka kwa seva hii (%s). Nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu na ufungue tikiti badala yake — hakuna chochote kuhusu mipangilio yako kilicho kibaya.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn® umepokea ripoti yako na utajibu kupitia barua pepe.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn® una ripoti yako — rejeleo %s — na utajibu kwa barua pepe.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Umetuma ripoti kadhaa kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache na ujaribu tena — zile za awali ziliwasili.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kupokea ripoti hiyo kwa sasa — hilo ni tatizo letu, si lako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni, au nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu kwenye tiketi.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Ripoti imekataliwa (HTTP %d). Iiga hapo juu na ufungue tikiti, ukitaja nambari hiyo.','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Wateja wa hosting? Pata punguzo la %1$d%% kwenye %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Kama mteja wa uenyeji wa Zinn Digital®, unapata msimbo wa kibinafsi wa punguzo la %d%% kwenye malipo yako ya kwanza. Upyaji uko kwa bei ya kawaida.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Pata msimbo wangu wa %d%% na uende kulipa','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Samahani, huruhusiwi kufanya hivyo.','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Punguzo hili ni kwa ajili ya wateja walio na mpango wa mwenyeji unaolipishwa na ulio katika hali nzuri. Majaribio ya bure hayastahili.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Tayari umetumia punguzo lako la mteja wa hosting kwa programu jalizi hii.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Hatukuweza kupata msimbo wako kwa sasa. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya watumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Utoaji wa Zinn® kwa ajili ya WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamiaji wa bure na kidhibiti kilichoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti, vikoa na nafasi za viungo zilizowekwa tayari, huku pesa zikiwekwa kwa usalama hadi pande zote mbili zitakapofurahi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii kwa ajili ya riziki','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, watengenezaji na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwaruhusu watoe zabuni.','Style preset'=>'Kielelezo cha mtindo kilichowekwa mapema','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Sehemu ya kuanzia. Chochote kilicho hapa chini kinabatilisha hili.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Tumia rangi na saizi zangu mwenyewe','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Acha hili lisiwe limewashwa na kielelezo kilichowekwa awali kitatumika jinsi kilivyo.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'ufunguo wa leseni','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Mtumiaji bado hajahusishwa na leseni, jambo ambalo ni muhimu ili kuzuia uanzishaji usioidhinishwa. Ili kumkabidhi mtumiaji wako leseni hiyo, unakubali kushiriki jina kamili na anwani ya barua pepe ya mtumiaji wako wa WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'tovuti zilizotajwa hapo juu','Account'=>'Akaunti','Account Details'=>'Maelezo ya Akaunti','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Akaunti inasubiri kuwezeshwa. Tafadhali angalia barua pepe yako na ubofye kiungo ili kuwezesha akaunti yako kisha utume tena fomu ya ushirika.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ungependa kuunganisha %1$s katika %2$s?','Actions'=>'Vitendo','Activate'=>'Washa','Activate Free Version'=>'Washa Toleo la Bure','Activate License'=>'Washa Leseni','activate a license here'=>'weka leseni hapa','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Tafadhali weka ufunguo wa leseni uliopokea kupitia barua pepe mara tu baada ya ununuzi:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Amsha leseni kwenye tovuti zote kwenye mtandao.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Washa leseni kwenye tovuti zote zinazosubiri.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'Toleo la kulipia la %1$s limesakinishwa tayari. Tafadhali liwashe ili uanze kufaidika na vipengele vya %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'Toleo la kulipia la %1$s limesakinishwa tayari. Tafadhali nenda kwenye %2$s ili kuiwasha na uanze kufaidika na vipengele vya %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Washa nyongeza hii','Activate %s'=>'Washa %s','Activate %s features'=>'Washa vipengele vya %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Kamilisha Uwashaji wa "%s" Sasa','Activate %s Plan'=>'Washa Mpango wa %s','Activated'=>'Imewashwa','Activating'=>'Inawashwa','Activating license'=>'Inawasha leseni','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Akaunti yako imeamilishwa vizuri kwa mpango wa %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Inayotumika','Add another domain'=>'Ongeza kikoa kingine','Add-Ons'=>'Viongezao','Add Ons for %s'=>'Viongezao vya %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Hatukuweza kupakia orodha ya nyongeza. Huenda hili ni tatizo kwa upande wetu, tafadhali jaribu kurudi baada ya dakika chache.','Add-On'=>'Ongezo','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s ni nyongeza ya malipo pekee. Lazima ununue leseni kwanza kabla ya kuwasha programu-jalizi hii.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'Kyongeza cha %s kimenunuliwa kwa mafanikio.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Mpango wako wa nyongeza wa %s umesasishwa kwa mafanikio.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'Jaribio la bure la %s limeghairiwa kwa mafanikio. Kwa kuwa programu-jalizi hii ni ya kulipia pekee, imezimwa kiotomatiki. Ikiwa ungependa kuitumia siku za usoni, utahitaji kununua leseni.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s haiwezi kuendesha bila programu-jalizi.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s haiwezi kufanya kazi bila %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Ninakujulisha tu kwamba maelezo ya viongezeo vya %s yanavukwa kutoka kwenye seva ya nje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Visingi vya moduli %s','Address'=>'Anwani','Address Line %d'=>'Mstari wa Anwani %d','Affiliate'=>'Mshirika','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Kutokana na kukiuka sheria zetu za ushirika, tumeamua kusimamisha kwa muda akaunti yako ya ushirika. Ikiwa una maswali yoyote, tafadhali wasiliana na huduma kwa wateja.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Akaunti yako ya ushirika imesimamishwa kwa muda.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Maombi yako ya ushirika kwa ajili ya %1$s yamekubaliwa! Ingia katika eneo lako la ushirika kupitia: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Asante kwa kuomba kujiunga na programu yetu ya washirika, kwa bahati mbaya, tumeamua kwa sasa kukataa ombi lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya siku 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Asante kwa kutuma maombi yako ya kujiunga na mpango wetu wa washirika, tutakagua maelezo yako katika siku 14 zijazo na tutakurudia na taarifa zaidi.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'kuki ya ufuatiliaji ya %s baada ya ziara ya kwanza ili kuongeza uwezo wa mapato.','Affiliation'=>'Ushirika','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Mara tu leseni yako itakapokwisha muda wake bado unaweza kutumia toleo la Bure lakini HUTAWA na ufikiaji wa vipengele vya %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Mara tu leseni yako itakapokwisha muda wake, hutaweza tena kutumia %s, isipokuwa ukiwezesha tena kwa leseni halali ya kulipia.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Bado unaweza kufurahia vipengele vyote vya %1$s lakini hutakuwa na ufikiaji wa usalama wa %2$s na masasisho ya vipengele, wala usaidizi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Asante kwa kuboresha.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Baada ya %1$s yako ya bure, lipa kiasi kidogo kama %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Kubali na Kuamilisha Leseni','I Agree - Change User'=>'Nakubali - Badilisha Mtumiaji','All Requests'=>'Maombi Yote','All Types'=>'Aina zote','allow'=>'ruhusu','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Tayari umejiandikisha kushiriki katika ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, ambao unatusaidia kuendelea kuboresha %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Umeshajijiandikisha kwenye ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, jambo ambalo linatusaidia kuendelea kuyaboresha.','Amount'=>'Kiasi','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Ya kila mwaka','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kila mwaka','Anonymous feedback'=>'Maoni ya bila kujulikana','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti zote kwenye mtandao.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti zote zinazosubiri.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Omba kuwa mshirika','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Idhinisha & Anza Jaribio','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Tafadhali tuambie sababu ili tuweze kuboresha.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Weka anwani ya barua pepe uliyotumia kwa ajili ya kuboresha hapa chini na tutakutumia tena ufunguo wa leseni.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Weka anwani ya barua pepe uliyotumia wakati wa ununuzi nasi tutakutumia tena ufunguo wa leseni.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Unganisha na akaunti ya mmiliki wa leseni.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Mwandishi','Invalid module ID.'=>'Kitambulisho cha moduli si sahihi.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Huna leseni halali ya kufikia toleo la malipo.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Kusakinisha kiotomatiki hufanya kazi tu kwa watumiaji waliowezesha chaguo hili.','Premium version already active.'=>'Toleo la malipo tayari liko hai.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Toleo la nyongeza la kulipia limesanikishwa tayari.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Plugin ni "Serviceware" jambo ambalo linamaanisha kuwa haina toleo la msimbo la kulipia.','Automatic Installation'=>'Usakinishaji wa Kiotomatiki','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Kuzima kiotomatiki baada ya:','Average Rating'=>'Wastani wa Ukadiriaji','Awesome'=>'Nzuri Sana','based on %s'=>'kulingana na %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Kuwa mshirika','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Unapenda %s? Kuwa Balozi wetu na ujipatie pesa taslimu ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Hujambo, je, ulijua kuwa %1$s ina programu ya washirika? Ikiwa unapenda %2$s unaweza kuwa balozi wetu na kupata pesa taslimu!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Bora','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Sasisho kwa toleo la Beta litabadilisha toleo lako lililosakinishwa la %s na toleo jipya zaidi la Beta - tumia kwa tahadhari, na wala si kwenye tovuti za uzalishaji. Umeonywa.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'Imelipiwa %s','Billing'=>'Malipo','Billing & Invoices'=>'Ankara na Risiti','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'Imefungwa','Blocking'=>'Inasimamisha','Blog ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Blogu','Body'=>'Mwili','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Ndiyo - anwani zote mbili ni zangu','Bundle'=>'Kifurushi','Bundle Plan'=>'Mpango wa Kifurushi','Business name'=>'Jina la biashara','Buy license'=>'Nunua leseni','Buy a license now'=>'Nunua leseni sasa','Cancel'=>'Ghairi','Cancel Installation'=>'Ghairisha Usakinishaji','Cancel Subscription'=>'Ghairi Usajili','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Iwapo HUPANGI kutumia %1$s hii kwenye tovuti hii (au tovuti nyingine yoyote) - ungependa kusitisha %2$s hiyo pia?','Cancel Trial'=>'Ghairi Jaribio','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Kufuta kipindi cha majaribio kutazuia mara moja ufikiaji wa vipengele vyote vya kulipia. Una uhakika?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Ghairi %s & Endelea','Cancelled'=>'Imetengwa','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Inazima usajili','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Hupati ufunguo wako wa leseni?','Change License'=>'Badilisha Leseni','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Barua pepe ya uthibitisho imetumwa tu kwa %s. Lazima uthibitishe sasisho hili ndani ya saa 4 zijazo. Ikiwa huwezi kupata barua pepe hiyo, tafadhali angalia folda yako ya taka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Barua pepe ya uthibitisho imetumwa tu kwa %s. Mmiliki wa barua pepe lazima athibitishe sasisho hilo ndani ya saa 4 zijazo.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s ndiye mmiliki mpya wa akaunti.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Asante kwa kuthibitisha mabadiliko ya umiliki. Barua pepe imetumwa tu kwa %s kwa ajili ya idhinisho la mwisho.','Change Ownership'=>'Badilisha Umiliki','Change Plan'=>'Badilisha Mpango','Change User'=>'Badilisha Mtumiaji','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Kwa kubadilisha mtumiaji, unakubali kuhamisha umiliki wa akaunti kwenda kwa:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Orodha ya Mabadiliko','Changing user, please wait'=>'Inabadilisha mtumiaji, tafadhali subiri','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Kama hukupokea barua pepe hiyo, jaribu kuangalia folda yako ya taka au utafute barua pepe kutoka kwa %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Lipa','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Chagua tovuti hadi %s za kuamilisha leseni.','City'=>'Jiji','Clear API Cache'=>'Futa Akiba ya API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Futa Vipindi Vya Sasisho Vinavyopita','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Bonyeza hapa','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Bonyeza hapa kutumia programu-jalizi hii bila kutaja jina lako','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Bonyeza ili uone maoni yaliyotoa ukadiriaji wa %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s ndiyo anwani ya barua pepe ya mteja wangu','Code'=>'Msimbo','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Tume %s wakati mteja anaponunua leseni mpya.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kwa kuwa tunatenga siku 30 kwa ajili ya uwezekano wa kurejeshewa fedha, tunalipa tu kamisheni ambazo ni za zaidi ya siku 30.','Communication'=>'Mawasiliano','Compatible up to'=>'Inatumika hadi','complete the opt-in'=>'kamilisha kujisajili','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Hongera','Never miss an important update'=>'Usikose kamwe sasisho muhimu','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Asante kwa kusasisha hadi %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Jiandikishe ili upate arifa za barua pepe kwa ajili ya usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, maudhui ya elimu, na matoleo ya mara kwa mara, na ili ushiriki maelezo ya msingi ya mazingira ya WordPress. Hii itatusaidia kufanya %s iendane zaidi na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kufanya kile unachohitaji ifanye.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Jisajili ili upate arifa za barua pepe kwa ajili ya usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, maudhui ya kielimu, na matoleo ya hapa na pale, na ili kushiriki baadhi ya maelezo ya msingi ya mazingira ya WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Ukiruka hili, hakuna nishida! %1$s bado itafanya kazi vizuri tu.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Tumeleta chaguo hili ili usipate kukosa sasisho muhimu na kutusaidia kufanya %s iendane vyema na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kufanya kile unachohitaji ifanye.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Tuna furaha kuanzisha ujumuishaji wa kiwango cha mtandao wa Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha, tumetambua tovuti %s kwenye mtandao ambazo bado zinahitaji umakini wako.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha, tumetambua tovuti %d ambazo bado zinasubiri uanzishaji wa leseni.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Ikiwa ungependa kutumia %s kwenye tovuti hizo, tafadhali weka ufunguo wako wa leseni hapa chini na ubofye kitufe cha kuwezesha.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Badala yake, unaweza kuiruka kwa sasa na kuwezesha leseni hiyo baadaye, katika ukurasa wa Akaunti ya kiwango cha mtandao wa %s yako.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Ukimaliza, zima %s kisha uiwashe tena.','Contact'=>'Wasiliana','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Tafadhali tujulishe iwapo ungependa tukutafute kwa ajili ya taarifa za usalama na vipengele, maudhui ya elimu, na matoleo ya mara chache:','Contact Support'=>'Wasiliana na Usaidizi','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Samahani kwa usumbufu na tuko hapa kusaidia ukitupa nafasi.','Contact Us'=>'Wasiliana Nasi','Please contact us here'=>'Tafadhali wasiliana nasi hapa','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Tafadhali wasiliana nasi kupitia ujumbe ufuatao:','Continue'=>'Endelea','Contributors'=>'Wachangiaji','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Imeshindwa kuamilisha %s.','Country'=>'Nchi','Cron Type'=>'Aina ya Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Tunatum کتابا ya PHP cURL kwa ajili ya miito ya API, ambayo ni maktaba ya kawaida sana na mara nyingi imewekwa na kuwashwa tangu mwanzo. Kwa bahati mbaya, cURL haijawashwa (au imezimwa) kwenye seva yako.','data'=>'data','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'Hali ya utatuzi imewashwa kwa mafanikio na itazimwa kiotomatiki baada ya dakika 60. Unaweza pia kuizima mapema kwa kubofya kiungo cha "Simamisha Utatuzi".','Date'=>'Tarehe','Deactivate'=>'Zima','Deactivate the free version'=>'Zima toleo la bure','Deactivate License'=>'Zima Leseni','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Kuzima leseni yako kutazima vipengele vyote vya kulipia, lakini kutakuwezesha kuamilisha leseni kwenye tovuti nyingine. Je, una hakika unataka kuendelea?','Deactivation'=>'Kuzima','Yes - %s'=>'Ndiyo - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Wasilisha & %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Kuzima au kusanidua %s kutazima leseni kiotomatiki, ambayo utaweza kuitumia kwenye tovuti nyingine.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Kama una nafasi, tafadhali tujulishe kwa nini wewe ni %s','Debug Log'=>'Kumbukumbu ya Utatuzi','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Utatuzi wa Makosa','delegate'=>'kabidhi','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Ukibofya, uamuzi huu utapewa kwa watawala wa tovuti.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'Wape ruhusa Wasimamizi wa Tovuti','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'Mkabidhi kwa Wasimamizi wa Tovuti na Uendelee','Delegating, please wait'=>'Inaendelea kukabidhiwa, tafadhali subiri','verbDelete'=>'Futa','Delete All Accounts'=>'Futa Akaunti Zote','Are you sure you want to delete all Freemius data?'=>'Je, una uhakika kuwa unataka kufuta data zote za Freemius?','Plugin installer section titleDescription'=>'Maelezo','Details'=>'Maelezo','seems like the key you entered doesn\'t match our rec