aidi.','You should receive %3$s for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s in the next 5 minutes.'=>'Unapaswa kupokea %3$s ya %1$s kwenye sanduku lako la barua pepe katika %2$s katika dakika 5 zijazo.','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'Nambari ya Posta',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s ili kufikia toleo la %2$s la usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, na usaidizi.','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'Masasisho ya kiotomatiki ya usalama & vipengele vya %1$s na utendakazi unaolipishwa vitaendelea kufanya kazi bila kukatizwa hadi %2$s (au leseni yako itakapokwisha, chochote kitakachotangulia).','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s ili kufikia toleo la %2$s la usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, na usaidizi.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea wakati wa kujaribu kuweka modi ya beta ya mtumiaji.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea wakati wa kujaribu kuwasha au kuzima hali ya lebo-nyeupe ya leseni.','Annual'=>'Ya mwaka','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Kwa kubofya "Jiondoe", %s hataweza tena kuona jina lako na barua pepe yako.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Kwa kubofya "Jiondoe", data ya uchunguzi haitatum আরও tena kwa %s.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Kwa kukata muunganisho wa tovuti hii, data za utambuzi zilizoshirikiwa awali kuhusu %1$s zitafutwa na hazitaonekana tena kwa %2$s.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Kwa kujiondoa kwenye kushiriki habari hii na seva ya sasisho, utalazimika kuangalia matoleo mapya ya %1$s na kuyapakua na kuyasakinisha kwa mkono. Sio tu usumbufu, lakini kukosa sasisho kunaweza kuhatarisha tovuti yako na kusababisha matatizo ya utangamano yasiyo ya lazima, kwa hiyo tunapendekeza sana kuweka ruhusa hizi muhimu zikiwa zimewashwa.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Ghairi %1$s - Sihitaji tena sasisho zama za usalama na vipengele, wala usaidizi wa %2$s kwa sababu sipangi kutumia %3$s kwenye tovuti hii, au nyingine yoyote.','Cancel %s?'=>'Ghairisha %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Inaghairi %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Inaghairi %s...','Click here'=>'Bonyeza hapa','Deactivating'=>'Inazima','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Kutenganisha tovuti kutauondoa kabisa %s kutoka kwa akaunti ya Dashibodi ya Mtumiaji wako.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Kwa ajili ya kuwasilisha kiotomatiki kwa usasishaji wa usalama na vipengele, na usimamizi na ulinzi wa leseni, %s inahitaji:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Kwa ajili ya kuwasilisha masasisho ya usalama na vipengele, na usimamizi wa leseni, %s inahitaji','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius ni mfumo wetu wa kutoa leseni na kusasisha programu','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Ikiwa hili ni rudufu la muda mrefu, ili kuweka masasisho ya kiotomatiki na utendakazi unaolipishwa baada ya %1$s, tafadhali %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Je, %2$s ni nakala rudufu ya %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Jiunge na Mpango wa Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Jiunge na mpango wa Beta','License'=>'Leseni','License Key'=>'Ufunguo wa Leseni','License key'=>'Ufunguo wa leseni','Monthly'=>'Kila mwezi','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Majina, slug, matoleo, na kama imewashwa au la','New Version Available'=>'Toleo Jipya Linapatikana','Optional'=>'Si lazima','Plan'=>'Mpango','Products'=>'Bidhaa','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Kushiriki data ya uchunguzi husaidie kutoa utendakazi wa ziada unaofaa kwa tovuti yako, kuepuka kutopatana kwa toleo la WordPress au PHP ambako kunaweza kuvunja tovuti, na kutambua lugha na maeneo ambayo %s inapaswa kutafsiriwa na kulengwa.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Ili uweze kutumia tena leseni wakati %s haifanyi kazi tena.','Subscription'=>'Usajili','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s itakuwa ikituma mara kwa mara data muhimu ya leseni kwenda %2$s ili kuangalia usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, na kuthibitisha uhalali wa leseni yako.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Kuna %1$s ya %2$s inapatikana.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Ili kuhakikisha utangamano na kuepuka migongano na programu jalizi na mandhari zako zilizosakinishwa.','Trial'=>'Jaribio','View %s State'=>'Tazama Hali ya %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Tazama Taarifa za Msingi za %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ndio, %2$s ni nakala rudufu ya %4$s kwa madhumuni ya majaribio, uwekaji wa jukwaa, au ukuzaji.','You have a %s license.'=>'Una leseni ya %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Umenunua leseni ya %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Unapaswa kupokea barua pepe ya uthibitisho kwa ajili ya %1$s kwenye sanduku lako la barua katika %2$s. Tafadhali hakikisha unabonyeza kitufe kilicho kwenye barua pepe hiyo ili %3$s.','days'=>'siku','deactivating'=>'inazima','hour'=>'saa','hours'=>'saa','license'=>'leseni','optional'=>'si lazima','products'=>'bidhaa','skip'=>'ruka','subscription'=>'usanifu','trial'=>'jaribio','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Bidhaa','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Inawashwa','as software licenseLicense'=>'Leseni','close a windowDismiss'=>'Ondoa','close windowDismiss'=>'Ondoa','like websitesSites'=>'Tovuti','nounPricing'=>'Bei','trial periodTrial'=>'Jaribio','verbOpt In'=>'Jiandikishe','verbOpt Out'=>'Jiondoe','verbSkip'=>'Ruka','verbUpgrade'=>'Boresha','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s iliyopita','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Kitendo hakikuweza kukamilishwa. Jaribu tena, na ikiwa kitaendelea kushindwa, wasiliana na msimamizi wa tovuti.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Thamani inayohitajika inakosekana au ina umbizo lisilo sahihi. Angalia mpango wa ingizo wa uwezo huo.','The site refused the request.'=>'Tovuti imekataa ombi hilo.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Ruhusu wasaidizi wa AI kama vile Claude, Cursor au VS Code wafanye kazi kwenye tovuti hii kwa ajili yako kupitia MCP (Model Context Protocol). Wanaingia kama mtumiaji wa WordPress aliye na nenosiri la programu na wanaweza kufanya tu kile ambacho mtumiaji huyo anaruhusiwa kufanya.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakala wa AI wanahitaji WordPress 6.9 au matoleo ya baadaye. Sasisha WordPress ili uweze kuitumia.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Anwani ya muunganisho (Sehemu ya mwisho ya MCP)','Create an application password for your user'=>'Undaa nenosiri la programu kwa mtumiaji wako','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ongeza hii kwenye mipangilio ya MCP ya programu yako ya AI, pamoja na jina lako la mtumiaji na nenosiri hilo:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: weka ingizo lile lile chini ya "servers" katika .vscode/mcp.json, sio chini ya "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Zana ambazo wakala wa AI anaweza kutumia hapa (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Mwongozo wa mtumiaji: Mawakala wa AI na MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Nyaraka za watengenezaji: uwezo, REST na MCP','Check and purge this site\'s cache and change its cache settings with Zinn® Cache.'=>'Angalia na ufute kashi ya tovuti hii na ubadilishe mipangilio yake ya kashi ukitumia Zinn® Cache.','Page and object cache status, purging and settings.'=>'Hali ya kache ya ukurasa na kipengee, usafishaji na mipangilio.','Read the cache status'=>'Soma hali ya kache','Returns whether the page cache and the object cache are on and working, how many pages are cached, and the object cache\'s connection and hit numbers.'=>'Inarejesha iwapo akiba ya kurasa na akiba ya vitu vimewashwa na vinafanya kazi, ni kurasa ngapi zilizohifadhiwa kwenye akiba, na muunganisho wa akiba ya vitu na nambari za kupigwa.','Read the cache settings'=>'Soma mipangilio ya kache','Returns every cache setting. The Redis password is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Inarejesha kila mpangilio wa kache. Nenosiri la Redis halirudishwi kamili, bali linaonyesha tu iwapo limehifadhiwa.','Change the cache settings'=>'Badilisha mipangilio ya kache','Changes the settings you send and keeps the rest (page cache, how long pages stay cached, the object cache and its Redis connection, purging rules and exclusions). Values are checked and corrected exactly as on the Cache screen.'=>'Inabadilisha mipangilio unayotuma na kuweka iliyobaki (akiba ya ukurasa, muda ambao kurasa hukaa kwenye akiba, akiba ya kitu na muunganisho wake wa Redis, sheria za kufuta na vizuizi). Thamani zinakaguliwa na kusahihishwa kikamilifu kama ilivyo kwenye skrini ya Akiba.','Put the cache settings back to their defaults'=>'Rejesha mipangilio ya kache kwenye hali yao ya awali','Puts every cache setting back to its default, as the Reset button does. The saved Redis password is removed too.'=>'Hurejesha kila mpangilio wa kache kwenye hali yake chaguomsingi, kama ifanyavyo kitufe cha Kuweka upya. Nenosiri lililohifadhiwa la Redis nalo linaondolewa.','Read the diagnostics report'=>'Soma ripoti ya utambuzi','Returns the diagnostics report support asks for: versions, server limits, the cache state and recent errors. It holds no passwords or keys.'=>'Inarudisha ripoti ya utambuzi ambayo usaidizi unaomba: matoleo, vikomo vya seva, hali ya akiba (cache) na hitilafu za hivi karibuni. Haina nywila wala funguo zozote.','Purge the cache'=>'Futa akiba','Discards cached pages: everything (all: true), some addresses (urls) or everything tagged (tags). Pages are rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Inakata kurasa zilizohifadhiwa kwenye kache: kila kitu (all: true), anwani fulani (urls) au kila kitu kilicho na lebo (tags). Kurasa hujengwa upya wageni wanapowasili.']];